{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1109116-help-with-a-weaponry-based-character","id":1109116,"title":"Help with a weaponry based character.","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-06-28T22:41:55-07:00","id":1109116,"title":"Help with a weaponry based character.","content":"I've been wanting to make a weaponry based character for a bit, but I'm not entirely sure how best to design such a character. Generally when I've built weaponry based characters they've fallen short like when my characters get into grapple situations or similar stuff. Are there any fighting styles that help with stuff like that, or should I just increase my characters defense trait as much as possible?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12436-ever-professional","name":"Ever Professional","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12436_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"506"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-29T00:13:59-07:00","id":1109130,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ever Professional</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1109116-help-with-a-weaponry-based-character#post1109116\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I've been wanting to make a weaponry based character for a bit, but I'm not entirely sure how best to design such a character. Generally when I've built weaponry based characters they've fallen short like when my characters get into grapple situations or similar stuff. Are there any fighting styles that help with stuff like that, or should I just increase my characters defense trait as much as possible?</div> </div> </div> </div>Make your weaponry specialization, and specialize slightly in grappling as well? IIRC there was a dot in Police Tactics that penalized trying to disarm you too.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12191-malus","name":"Malus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12191_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1562"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-29T01:32:23-07:00","id":1109148,"title":"","content":"For your grappling problem specifically, I can recommend the following, though I recommend not trying to get all of these merits at character creation since it will leave you highly mono-focused and weak in several other areas that matter:<br /> <br /> Take Brawl \u2022 and a specialty in Grappling.<br /> Take Weaponry \u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022+ and a specialty in whatever weapon.<br /> Take Dexterity + Wits \u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022+<br /> Take Double Jointed \u2022\u2022\u2022<br /> Take Fighting Finesse \u2022\u2022 for both Grappling &amp; your Weaponry specialty<br /> Take Defensive Combat \u2022 for Weaponry<br /> <br /> You'll have 8 Defense, making establishing grapples difficult. If someone lands one on you, they'll be rolling at -4 to keep you in the grapple, while you will have a dice pool of 6. Your DP with your actual weapon doesn't suffer much, sitting at 9.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3570-lnodiv","name":"lnodiv","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3570_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1607"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}